      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "The same node under another ruleset. In Brian's Brain a cell fires, spends a step resting and only then can fire again, so nothing ever settles and sparks travel in streams. Switch the Algorithm to HighLife, whose replicators copy themselves, or Day and Night, where live and dead are mirror images; press Randomize after each."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
